-- === 2. Hong Kong Airport Terminal 1 ===
UPDATE posts SET content = '
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;background:#f8f6f3;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:32px;">
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Timeline</strong><br/>2025</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Products</strong><br/>Honeycomb Panels + Profile Baffles</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Scope</strong><br/>Terminal 1 Renovation</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Services</strong><br/>3D Scanning, BIM, Manufacturing</div>
</div>

<h2>Project Overview</h2>
<p>Hong Kong International Airport Terminal 1, one of Asia''s busiest passenger hubs, undertook a comprehensive renovation of its corridor and transition zones. The project required a dual-system approach: aluminum honeycomb panels for wall cladding and extruded profile baffle ceilings — both needing to integrate seamlessly within an operational terminal environment.</p>

<h2>The Challenge</h2>
<p>Working inside a live airport terminal created extraordinary logistical constraints. All installation work had to occur during overnight maintenance windows (00:00–05:00), with zero disruption to daytime passenger operations. The ceiling system also needed to provide quick-access panels for the extensive MEP (mechanical, electrical, plumbing) services running above the ceiling plane — a critical requirement for airport facilities.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1780036040852-hong-kong-international-airport-terminal-1-profile-baffle-ceiling-project-1.jpg" alt="HK Airport Terminal 1 corridor with profile baffle ceiling" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />

<h2>Our Solution</h2>
<p>We delivered an integrated wall-and-ceiling system using 3D laser scanning and BIM modelling to achieve millimeter-precision fit within the existing terminal structure. The honeycomb wall panels provided a rigid, impact-resistant surface ideal for high-traffic corridors, while the profile baffle ceiling featured a quick-release mechanism allowing individual panels to be removed and reinstalled in under 60 seconds for maintenance access.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1781772086419-hong-kong-airport-honeycomb-wall-cladding-and-baffle-ceiling-project-20.jpg" alt="Honeycomb wall cladding detail" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1781772077244-hong-kong-airport-honeycomb-wall-cladding-and-baffle-ceiling-project-14.jpg" alt="Multi-size baffle ceiling design" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>Precision Manufacturing</h2>
<p>Every component was CNC-manufactured to tolerances of ±0.5mm, verified through our in-house quality inspection process before shipping. The profile baffles were produced in multiple depths to create a rhythmic visual pattern across the corridor, while maintaining uniform acoustic performance throughout.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1781772063441-hong-kong-airport-honeycomb-wall-cladding-and-baffle-ceiling-project-5.jpg" alt="Quality inspection" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1781772061702-hong-kong-airport-honeycomb-wall-cladding-and-baffle-ceiling-project-4.jpg" alt="Production stage" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1781772060294-hong-kong-airport-honeycomb-wall-cladding-and-baffle-ceiling-project-3.jpg" alt="Baffle detail" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>Installation & Results</h2>
<p>The modular system enabled our installation team to work efficiently within the tight overnight windows. Pre-assembled ceiling modules arrived on-site with all fixings pre-attached, reducing installation time by 40% compared to traditional stick-built systems. The completed renovation delivered a modern, cohesive aesthetic across Terminal 1 corridors while maintaining full operational access to building services.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1781774115109-hong-kong-airport-honeycomb-wall-cladding-and-profile-baffle-ceiling-project-1.jpg" alt="Completed HK Airport Terminal 1 corridor" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />

<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;">
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Wall System</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Aluminum honeycomb panels, 25mm total thickness</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Ceiling System</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Extruded aluminum profile baffles, variable depth</td></tr>
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Surface Finish</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">PVDF + powder coating, unified color system</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Access System</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Quick-release panels, 60-second removal</td></tr>
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Survey Method</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">3D laser scanning + BIM modelling</td></tr>
</table>
