  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1777519101219-dubai-emaar-beachfront-bayview-and-seapoint-metal-ceiling-1.jpg" alt="Building facade and ceiling integration" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>Manufacturing & Logistics</h2>
<p>The scale of this project required precise manufacturing coordination: over 200,000 individual ceiling components were produced, quality-checked, and packaged for sequential delivery across 18 months. Our factory operated dedicated production lines to ensure color consistency across all batches — a critical requirement when panels installed months apart must match perfectly.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1777519102093-dubai-emaar-beachfront-bayview-and-seapoint-metal-ceiling-6.jpg" alt="Ceiling installation in progress" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />

