-- === 5. Haikou Hongyuan Hotel ===
UPDATE posts SET content = '
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;background:#f8f6f3;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:32px;">
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Timeline</strong><br/>2024</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Products</strong><br/>Ceiling, Cladding & Sunshades</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Scope</strong><br/>Full Hotel Renovation</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Services</strong><br/>Heritage Design, Engineering</div>
</div>

<h2>Project Overview</h2>
<p>Haikou Hongyuan Hotel, a landmark hospitality property on Hainan Island, undertook a comprehensive renovation that required aluminum systems honoring traditional Chinese Song Dynasty architectural aesthetics while delivering modern performance standards. The project encompassed exterior sunshades, facade cladding, interior ceilings, and semi-outdoor corridor systems.</p>

<h2>The Challenge</h2>
<p>Hainan Island''s tropical climate — intense UV radiation, frequent typhoons, and extreme humidity — creates one of the harshest environments for building materials in China. Traditional wooden architectural elements that define Song Dynasty style cannot survive these conditions, yet the hotel''s design vision demanded authentic cultural expression. The solution required aluminum systems that visually replicate traditional craftsmanship while providing weather resistance rated for tropical coastal exposure.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1762420356721-hongyuan-hotel-aluminum-ceiling-and-cladding-6.jpg" alt="Hongyuan Hotel exterior with aluminum cladding" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />

<h2>Our Solution</h2>
<p>We developed a comprehensive aluminum system package that translates Song Dynasty design language into modern metal fabrication:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Sunshade Louvers:</strong> Laser-cut aluminum louvers with traditional cloud-scroll patterns, powder-coated in warm bronze tones</li>
  <li><strong>Column Cladding:</strong> Aluminum panel wraps with wood-grain PVDF finish for south gate columns</li>
  <li><strong>Corridor Ceilings:</strong> Aluminum plank ceilings in semi-outdoor transition spaces with integrated drainage</li>
  <li><strong>Grille Screens:</strong> Decorative aluminum grille panels inspired by traditional Chinese window lattice designs</li>
</ul>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1762420271541-hongyuan-hotel-aluminum-ceiling-and-cladding-12.jpg" alt="Grille screen and sunshade louvers" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1762420117415-hongyuan-hotel-aluminum-ceiling-and-cladding-8.jpg" alt="Column cladding rendering" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1762420504935-hongyuan-hotel-aluminum-ceiling-and-cladding-14.jpg" alt="North reception hall ceiling" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1762420225615-hongyuan-hotel-aluminum-ceiling-and-cladding-13.jpg" alt="Semi-outdoor corridor ceiling" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>Results</h2>
<p>The completed renovation successfully bridges historical Chinese architectural identity with contemporary material performance. The aluminum systems will maintain their appearance for 20+ years in Hainan''s tropical environment — something impossible with traditional timber construction — while preserving the cultural authenticity that defines the Hongyuan Hotel brand.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1762420777095-hongyuan-hotel-aluminum-ceiling-and-cladding-3.jpg" alt="Completed hotel exterior night view" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />
' WHERE slug = 'haikou-hongyuan-hotel-aluminum-ceiling';

-- === 6. Shenzhen MixC World ===
UPDATE posts SET content = '
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;background:#f8f6f3;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:32px;">
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Timeline</strong><br/>2024</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Products</strong><br/>Triangle Metal Great Wall Panel</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Scope</strong><br/>Elevator Lobby Wall Cladding</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Services</strong><br/>Custom Fabrication, Design Support</div>
</div>

<h2>Project Overview</h2>
<p>Shenzhen MixC World — one of the city''s premier mixed-use retail destinations — required distinctive wall cladding for its elevator lobbies. The design team sought a bold, three-dimensional wall treatment that would create a memorable visual identity for shoppers transitioning between floors.</p>

<h2>The Challenge</h2>
<p>Elevator lobbies in high-traffic shopping malls face constant physical contact from thousands of daily visitors. The wall cladding needed to resist impact, scratches, and fingerprints while delivering the dramatic visual impact the designers envisioned. Traditional flat wall panels lacked the dimensional quality needed, while conventional 3D wall systems were either too fragile or too expensive for the project budget.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1763024262298-shopping-mall-triangular-metal-great-wall-panel-project-8.jpg" alt="Shenzhen MixC elevator lobby with triangle metal panels" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />

<h2>Our Solution</h2>
<p>We developed a custom triangle-profile metal "Great Wall" panel system. Each panel features a repeating triangular cross-section that creates dynamic light and shadow effects throughout the day — the visual appearance changes dramatically as natural and artificial lighting angles shift. The panels were fabricated from 1.2mm aluminum with a brushed finish that hides fingerprints and minor scratches.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1763024260453-shopping-mall-triangular-metal-great-wall-panel-project-6.jpg" alt="Triangular geometry visual depth" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1763024255924-shopping-mall-triangular-metal-great-wall-panel-project-2.jpg" alt="Triangle panel detail" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>Installation & Performance</h2>
<p>The panels mount on a concealed aluminum sub-frame system, creating a clean, fastener-free visible surface. Each panel is individually removable for access to wall-mounted services (fire sprinklers, signage, emergency lighting). The brushed aluminum surface requires only periodic wiping with a damp cloth — no special cleaning chemicals needed — making it ideal for commercial maintenance schedules.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1763024257041-shopping-mall-triangular-metal-great-wall-panel-project-3.jpg" alt="Light and shadow effect on triangle panels" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />

<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;">
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Material</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">1.2mm Aluminum Alloy, brushed finish</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Profile Depth</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">40mm triangular cross-section</td></tr>
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Mounting</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Concealed aluminum sub-frame, removable panels</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Impact Resistance</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Class 3 (heavy-duty commercial)</td></tr>
</table>
' WHERE slug = 'shenzhen-mixc-triangle-metal-panel';

-- === 7. Shenzhen OPPO Headquarters ===
UPDATE posts SET content = '
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;background:#f8f6f3;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:32px;">
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Timeline</strong><br/>2023–2025</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Products</strong><br/>Facade, Woven Ceiling, Panels</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Scope</strong><br/>185,000 sqm, 42 Floors</div>
  <div><strong style="color:#c09020;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Services</strong><br/>Full Engineering + Installation</div>
</div>

<h2>Project Overview</h2>
<p>OPPO''s new Shenzhen headquarters is one of China''s most architecturally ambitious office developments: four interconnected elliptical towers reaching 200 meters in height across 42 floors, totaling 185,000 square meters. The building required custom aluminum facade systems, woven metal ceilings, hyperbolic panels, and scale-wall cladding — all following the tower''s complex curved geometry.</p>

<h2>The Challenge</h2>
<p>The elliptical tower geometry meant virtually no two facade panels were identical. Each of the thousands of aluminum panels needed to follow a unique curvature dictated by the building''s organic form. Additionally, the project demanded premium interior finishes for executive lobbies and common areas — including custom woven metal ceilings and hyperbolic aluminum panels that required advanced CNC fabrication capabilities.</p>

<img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m0/1733300458502-1.jpg" alt="OPPO Headquarters four elliptical towers exterior" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;" />

<h2>Facade System</h2>
<p>We engineered a unitized curtain wall system with custom aluminum profiles following the tower''s elliptical geometry. Each panel was CNC-fabricated to precise tolerances of ±1mm, with PVDF coating in a custom silver-grey finish selected for its heat-reflective properties — critical for reducing cooling loads in Shenzhen''s subtropical climate.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m0/1733295120340-2-1.jpg" alt="Building interior rendering" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m0/1733302916664-.jpg" alt="Scale facade wall detail" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>Woven Metal Ceiling</h2>
<p>The lobby and executive floors feature a bespoke woven aluminum ceiling system — interlocking metal strips that create a textile-like visual texture overhead. This system required custom tooling for production and a proprietary installation methodology to ensure consistent weave patterns across large ceiling areas.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m0/1733302944280-.jpg" alt="Woven metal ceiling detail" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m0/1733364257990-.jpg" alt="Woven ceiling production process" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>From 3D Model to Reality</h2>
<p>Our team used comprehensive BIM coordination to translate the architect''s 3D models into manufacturable components. Each panel was digitally mapped, numbered, and tracked from factory floor to installation position — ensuring the complex geometry was accurately realized on-site.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m4842/1741080768672-3d.jpg" alt="3D model vs installed comparison" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
  <img src="https://prancebuilding.com/lifisher-m0/1733365242070-2.jpg" alt="On-site installation in progress" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;" />
</div>

<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;">
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Building Height</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">200m, 42 floors</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Total Facade Area</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">185,000 sqm</td></tr>
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Panel Tolerance</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">±1mm CNC precision</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Facade Finish</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">PVDF, custom silver-grey heat-reflective</td></tr>
  <tr style="background:#f8f6f3;"><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Interior Systems</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Woven ceiling, hyperbolic panels, scale wall</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Coordination</td><td style="padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #e8e4df;">Full BIM, panel-by-panel digital tracking</td></tr>
</table>
' WHERE slug = 'shenzhen-oppo-headquarters-facade';

